{"html":"<p></p><figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"\">\n    <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 204px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 147.05882352941174%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" alt=\"thane furrows\" title=\"thane furrows\" src=\"/static/a1534e5fcfff7e324f53a977c945760e/c8387/thane-204x300.jpg\" srcset=\"/static/a1534e5fcfff7e324f53a977c945760e/c8387/thane-204x300.jpg 204w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 204px) 100vw, 204px\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">thane furrows</figcaption>\n  </figure><p></p>\n<p>The guy in the photo above is named <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0644203/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Steve Oedekerk</a>, the director/writer of the movies <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0315327/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Bruce Almighty</a>, <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0109040/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Ace Ventura</a>, <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0129290/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Patch Adams</a>, <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0240468/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Kung Pow</a> (in which he also acted), <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0119807/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Nothing to Lose</a>, among others. Well, the guy is simply a genius, and his first performance in the 1991 independent film <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0102032/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">High Strung</a> is excellent. The film portrays a typical day in the life of children’s book author Thane Furrows, who gets annoyed and complains about everything all the time. The movie is basically a <a href=\"http://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stand-up_comedy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Stand-up Comedy</a>. This video is from a part where Thane complains about his ex, it’s hilarious. Tip for those who like to laugh: <strong>WATCH THIS MOVIE</strong>.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"gatsby-resp-iframe-wrapper\" style=\"padding-bottom: 56.42857142857143%; position: relative; height: 0; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 1.0725rem\"> <div class=\"embedVideo-container\"> <iframe title=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/B9wFZyUSEBs?rel=0\" class=\"embedVideo-iframe\" style=\"border:0; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; \" loading=\"eager\" allowfullscreen=\"\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-popups\"></iframe> </div> </div><p></p>\n<p>Unfortunately, this movie doesn’t exist on DVD, and I also think it’s rare to find it in any video rental store on VHS. I have a digitized copy that I made from my <a href=\"http://shop.ebay.com/?_from=R40&amp;_trksid=m38&amp;_nkw=highstrungvhs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">tape I bought on Ebay</a>.</p>","path":"/en/blog/funny/idol-steve-oedekerk/","title":"Idol: Steve Oedekerk","language":"en","postHashId":"ZnVubnl0cnVlLi4vLi4vY292ZXJzLzIwMDgvcG9zdC1pZC0xNTgtY292ZXIucG5nMjAwOC0xMC0wMlQwMDowMDowMC4wMDBa","comments":[],"relatedPosts":[{"path":"/en/blog/tips/google-flights-op/","postHashId":"dGlwc3RydWUuLi8uLi9jb3ZlcnMvMjAxNS9wb3N0LWlkLTIyODQtY292ZXIucG5nMjAxNS0wNS0zMVQwMDowMDowMC4wMDBa","title":"Google Flights OP","date":"2015-05-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"path":"/en/blog/collectibles/lego-love/","postHashId":"Y29sbGVjdGlibGVzdHJ1ZS4uLy4uL2NvdmVycy8yMDEzL3Bvc3QtaWQtMjI0My1jb3Zlci5wbmcyMDEzLTAyLTA5VDAwOjAwOjAwLjAwMFo=","title":"Lego love","date":"2013-02-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"path":"/en/blog/games/new-handheld-revo-k101-gba-clone/","postHashId":"Z2FtZXN0cnVlLi4vLi4vY292ZXJzLzIw